CLASS zgk0612_cl_test_trade DEFINITION
  PUBLIC
  FINAL
  CREATE PUBLIC .

  PUBLIC SECTION.
    INTERFACES if_oo_adt_classrun.
  PROTECTED SECTION.
  PRIVATE SECTION.
ENDCLASS.



CLASS zgk0612_cl_test_trade IMPLEMENTATION.

  METHOD if_oo_adt_classrun~main.
    DATA: lo_trader TYPE REF TO zgk0612_cl_sdust_trader,
          lv_price  TYPE decfloat16.


    CREATE OBJECT lo_trader.
    TRY.

        DATA(lv_final_price) = lo_trader->buy_stardust( iv_stardust_id = 9
                                                        iv_buyer_name = 'Silver' ).

        out->write( 'Trade successful!' ).
        out->write( 'Final price: ' && lv_final_price && '$$' ).

      CATCH zgk0612_cx_trading_exception INTO DATA(lx_error).
        out->write( 'Error: ' && lx_error->message ).
    ENDTRY.
  ENDMETHOD.

ENDCLASS.